            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Tấm Măm",
            "review_text": "Quỳnh T\n2 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese Flavors in Hanoi Old Quarter\nJan 2026 • Friends\nMy friends and I found Com Tam Mam while walking around the Hanoi Old Quarter. We came in for a quick meal and were pleasantly surprised.\nWe ordered grilled pork with broken rice, vermicelli with BBQ pork, and a few other dishes to share. Everything was delicious, flavorful, and well cooked. Portions were generous and prices reasonable.The place is clean and cozy, and the staff were friendly. \nA great spot for authentic Vietnamese food. Would definitely come back!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGo early during peak hours, as it can get busy. The grilled pork with broken rice is a must-try.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 21, 2026",
