            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Tấm Măm",
            "review_text": "James C\n7 contributions\n0\nCasual spot with good food, gets crowded at peak hours\nJul 2025 • Family\nI live in Hanoi and came here with friends for dinner. We enjoyed the Cơm Sườn Bò (beef ribs with rice)—very tender meat and delicious rice. The crispy pork cracklings with pickled greens were great to snack on. Service was quick despite the restaurant being busy. Only downside is it gets pretty crowded, especially around dinner time, so can be noisy. Good prices, around 150k each with drinks. Would recommend reserving a table upstairs.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 9, 2025\nĐăng Cảnh M\nHi S3186FLjamesc,\n\nThank you for visiting Măm’s Kitchen and taking the time to leave such a thoughtful review!\n\nWe’re happy to hear you enjoyed the Cơm Sườn Bò and crispy pork cracklings — those are some of our favorites too! It’s great to know you appreciated the quick service, even during peak hours.\n\nWe understand your point about the crowd and noise level during dinner time, and we agree — reserving a table upstairs is a smart tip. We’re always working to make the experience more comfortable for everyone.\n\nHope to welcome you and your friends again soon!\n\n—\n📍 Măm’s Kitchen has 2 locations:\n1️⃣ 47A Nguyễn Hữu Huân, Hoàn Kiếm, Hanoi\n2️⃣ 1st Floor, Lion Mall, 59 Xuân Diệu, Tây Hồ, Hanoi\n📞 Hotline: 024 4455 8868\n📩 Email: info@mams.vn\n🚚 Freeship tòa nhà D'Leroi Soleil (cơ sở Tây Hồ)\nRead more\nWritten July 19, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
