            "review_text": "Duy Pham\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nNice spot for quick lunch, can get crowded\nJun 2025 • Friends\nStopped by with colleagues during lunch break—rice was tasty, grilled pork flavorful, and salted kumquat drink refreshing. However, tables felt a bit small, and it gets crowded during peak times. Overall good value (~120k/person). Will return for weekday lunches.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 24, 2025\nĐăng Cảnh M\nHi 426pham,\n\nThank you so much for visiting Măm with your colleagues and for taking the time to share your experience! 🌟\n\nWe’re delighted to hear you enjoyed the tasty rice, flavorful grilled pork, and refreshing salted kumquat drink. We appreciate your feedback about the tables feeling a bit small and the crowd during peak hours. We’ll definitely look into ways to make the lunch rush more comfortable for our guests.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back for more delicious weekday lunches!\n\nBest regards,\nMăm’s Kitchen Team\nRead more\nWritten June 27, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
