            "review_text": "Khai T\n7 contributions\n0\nMust try Food in Vietnam\nMay 2025 • Solo\nThe food is tasty. I truly recommend you guys to try Cơm Tấm — The best dish in the restaurant, in my opinion. The dish contained carrot, white radish salt, sunny-side up egg, shredded pork skin, and grilled pork ribs.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 21, 2025\nĐăng Cảnh M\nHi 948khait,\n\nThank you so much for visiting Măm and sharing your great review!\n\nWe’re thrilled to hear that you enjoyed our Cơm Tấm and consider it the best dish in the restaurant. It means a lot to us that you appreciated the flavors and all the ingredients that make it special.\n\nWe hope to welcome you back soon for more delicious meals during your time in Vietnam!\n\nBest regards,\nMăm’s Kitchen Team\nRead more\nWritten June 27, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
